r time, are more likely to give up chasing you, and won't always land their attacks. You'll have more chances to escape and outsmart them.We've reduced the number of monsters on levels -2 to 2, giving you a bit more breathing room.Our demo is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:15:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4043580-1844751498234528","game_id":"steam-4043580","kind":"announcement","title":"SIGN UP for the PLAYTESTS!","summary":"Hello Brothers and Sisters!We have great news - you can now sign up for the RADZIMA playtests!How to join? Go to our Steam page and click 'Request Access.' That’s it!When will the playtests start? After sign-ups close, you will get an email invitation. So keep an eye on your inbox!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:02:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234528","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4043580-1843481262704502","game_id":"steam-4043580","kind":"update","title":"RADZIMA DEMO - HOTFIX","summary":"Hello Brothers and Sisters!We’ve just published another hotfix for our demo!Level 1 has been made easier, based on player feedbackNPCs are now slightly less sensitive to voice and footstep soundsSee you in the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T12:49:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4043580-1843481262694489","game_id":"steam-4043580","kind":"update","title":"RADZIMA DEMO - HOTFIX","summary":"Hello Brothers and Sisters!We’ve just released another hotfix for our demo!This update includes:Network usage optimizationsVoice chat improvementsSee you in the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T08:59:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4043580-1842846814450794","game_id":"steam-4043580","kind":"update","title":"RADZIMA DEMO - HOTFIX - Connecting to other regions FIXED","summary":"Hello Brothers and Sisters!We've just made the hotfix to our demo - connecting to other regions is FIXED now.You can now play with friends from other regions! The game will use the host's region.PS. Sorry about this issue - it's our first co-op game!PS. 2. Remember, it’s worth making sure you have the latest version of the game by verifying the game files on Steam.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T14:26:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4043580-1842212951297160","game_id":"steam-4043580","kind":"announcement","title":"RADZIMA DEMO IS OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello Brothers and Sisters!The RADZIMA Demo is OUT NOW on Steam!PLAY THE DEMO NOWRADZIMA is a 1–4 player co-op survival horror set in an underground research facility. Find radioactive items, avoid the mutants, and power the elevator reactor to descend deeper - all in service of the Party’s will.The demo will be available for a limited time only - until RADZIMA launches in Early Access - which is coming soon.Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T14:50:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4043580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4043580":"2026-10-26T11:22:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4043580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:52Z"},"4962570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:53Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4043580","app_id":4043580,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d5acfbcf24722fd0302312a54d8895b8bd07857b5a8d49a637d5f0a6f014943a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"RADZIMA는 지하 연구 시설을 배경으로 하는 1~4인 협동 서바이벌 호러 게임입니다. 방사성 물품을 찾아내고, 돌연변이를 피하며, 엘리베이터의 원자로에 동력을 공급해 더 깊은 곳으로 내려가세요. 모든 것은 당의 뜻을 위해서입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"PlayWay S.A.","creator_clan_account_id":33701576}],"developers":[{"name":"Rad Punks"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1787754640","trailer_category":0,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4043580/805167455/b17cac47232699ad417e82c4aa44ef713bc728f9/1787687149/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/we